<p style="margin-top:0;">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},</p>
<p>Per our Terms of Service, wholesale accounts that have not placed an order in 18 months are subject to deactivation. Your account, <b>{!Shopify_At_Risk_Notice__c.Store_Name__c}</b>, has not ordered since <b>{!Shopify_At_Risk_Notice__c.Last_Order_Date_At_Notice__c}</b>, which puts you approaching that window.</p>
<p>To keep your account active, simply place an order any time before <b>{!Shopify_At_Risk_Notice__c.Deactivation_Date__c}</b>. If you have questions about products, pricing, or your account, reply to this email or reach out to your account representative.</p>
<p>Best,</p>
<p><b>The goodr wholesale team</b></p>
